{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Silent Watcher is a first-person psychological horror game with a short but intense experience, centered on tension, an oppressive atmosphere, and the fear of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a young woman waiting for your partner to return home. Night falls, and with it, a disturbing feeling that something\u2014or someone\u2014is watching you from the shadows. Every reflection, every sound, every corner seems to hide an invisible presence... one that refuses to be ignored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game challenges you to explore a home while surviving a silent stalker. There are no weapons. There is no combat. Only sound, your intuition, and environmental details will be your tools to resist.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-person narrative psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay focused on exploration and role-playing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achievements available for the most observant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interface available in English and Spanish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive soundtrack and sound design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to remain calm when you feel you are no longer alone?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3843270?t=1754506527","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843270/641e92703d20076abe791588f934e5f737ff155c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754506527","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843270/732a0e771ad04d4b431b36e9181dbb3a0925ee85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754506527","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843270/732a0e771ad04d4b431b36e9181dbb3a0925ee85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754506527","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievemen